      },
      "text": "Since we have E[p∞]GK∞ = 0, the map H1(KΣ/Kn,E[p∞]) −→ H1(KΣ/K∞,E[p∞])[ωn] induced by the restriction map is isomorphism by the Inﬂation-Restriction exact sequence. There-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
