        "x1": 0.8831159663865545,
        "y1": 0.7957387173396675
      },
      "text": "fore, h±n is also isomorphism. By the snake lemma, s±n is injective, and it suﬃces to calculate the kernel of gn±.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
